slider33:4<0,11,1{500 Hz,600 Hz,700 Hz,800 Hz,1 kHz,1.2 kHz,1.5 kHz,1.8 kHz,2.2 kHz,2.7 kHz,3.3 kHz,4 kHz}>-EQ Tony Q: Tokyo mid freq
slider34:0<-15,15,1>-EQ Tony Q: Tokyo mid level (dB)
slider35:3<0,6,1{2.5 kHz,4 kHz,6 kHz,8 kHz,10 kHz,12.5 kHz,16 kHz}>-EQ Tony Q: Tokyo high freq
slider36:0<-15,15,1>-EQ Tony Q: Tokyo high level (dB)
