slider45:5<0,10,1{-12 dB,-9 dB,-6 dB,-4 dB,-2 dB,0 dB,+2 dB,+4 dB,+6 dB,+9 dB,+12 dB}>-EQ Tony Q: New York low gain
slider46:1<0,1,1{Peak,Shelf}>-EQ Tony Q: New York low shape
slider47:2<0,4,1{400 Hz,800 Hz,1.5 kHz,3 kHz,5 kHz}>-EQ Tony Q: New York mid freq
slider48:5<0,10,1{-12 dB,-9 dB,-6 dB,-4 dB,-2 dB,0 dB,+2 dB,+4 dB,+6 dB,+9 dB,+12 dB}>-EQ Tony Q: New York mid gain
slider49:2<0,4,1{5 kHz,7 kHz,10 kHz,12.5 kHz,15 kHz}>-EQ Tony Q: New York high freq
slider50:5<0,10,1{-12 dB,-9 dB,-6 dB,-4 dB,-2 dB,0 dB,+2 dB,+4 dB,+6 dB,+9 dB,+12 dB}>-EQ Tony Q: New York high gain
slider51:1<0,1,1{Peak,Shelf}>-EQ Tony Q: New York high shape
